doc:sec-10-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "10(1) Meaning of attribute of an individual" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) An attribute of an individual means information that is associated with the individual, and includes information that is derived from another attribute." ;
    cof:pageNumber "26"^^xsd:integer .

concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-10-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10(2) Meaning of attribute of an individual"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), an attribute of an individual includes the following: (a) the individual’s current or former name; (b) the individual’s current or former address; (c) the individual’s date of birth; (d) information about whether the individual is alive or dead; (e) the individual’s phone number; (f) the individual’s email address; (g) if the individual has a digital ID—the time and date the digital ID was created; (h) biometric information of the individual; (i) a restricted attribute of the individual; (j) information or an opinion about the individual’s: (i) racial or ethnic origin; or (ii) political opinions; or (iii) membership of a political association; or (iv) religious beliefs or affiliations; or (v) philosophical beliefs; or (vi) sexual orientation or practices.  Introduction  Chapter 1 Interpretation  Part 2  Section 11 Digital ID Act 2024 Compilation date: 21/02/2025" ;
    skos:definition "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), an attribute of an individual includes the following: (a) the individual’s current or former name; (b) the individual’s current or former address; (c) the individual’s date of birth; (d) information about whether the individual is alive or dead; (e) the individual’s phone number; (f) the individual’s email address; (g) if the individual has a digital ID—the time and date the digital ID was created; (h) biometric information of the individual; (i) a restricted attribute of the individual; (j) information or an opinion about the individual’s: (i) racial or ethnic origin; or (ii) political opinions; or (iii) membership of a political association; or (iv) religious beliefs or affiliations; or (v) philosophical beliefs; or (vi) sexual orientation or practices.  Introduction  Chapter 1 Interpretation  Part 2  Section 11 Digital ID Act 2024 Compilation date: 21/02/2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "82dfd00fa550d5dbe5b5bc5b50d35d91947c020530f4dd9a386902a375f2fc46" ;
