    values:originalText "(2) The Digital ID Regulator: (a) may impose conditions on the accreditation of an entity, either at the time of accreditation or at a later time, if the Digital ID Regulator considers that doing so is appropriate in the circumstances; and (b) must impose conditions on the accreditation of an entity, either at the time of accreditation or at a later time, if directed to do so under subsection 27(1)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "33"^^xsd:integer .

