    skos:prefLabel "17(4) Conditions on accreditation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-17-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Without limiting paragraph (2)(a), the Digital ID Regulator may impose conditions relating to the following: (a) any limitations, exclusions or restrictions in relation to the accredited services of the entity; (b) the circumstances or manner in which the accredited services of the entity must be provided;  Chapter 2  Accreditation" ;
