concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-23 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23 Notice of decision of changes to conditions on accreditation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Subject to subsection (2), the Digital ID Regulator must give an entity written notice of a decision to impose, vary or revoke a condition on an entity’s accreditation. (2) The Digital ID Regulator is not required to give an entity notice of the decision if notice of the condition was given in a notice under subsection 15(7). (3) The notice must: (a) state the condition or the variation, or state that the condition is revoked; and (b) state the day on which the condition, variation or revocation takes effect.  Accreditation  Chapter 2 Accreditation  Part 2 Varying, suspending and revoking accreditation  Division 3 Section 24 Digital ID Act 2024 Compilation date: 21/02/2025" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Subject to subsection (2), the Digital ID Regulator must give an entity written notice of a decision to impose, vary or revoke a condition on an entity’s accreditation. (2) The Digital ID Regulator is not required to give an entity notice of the decision if notice of the condition was given in a notice under subsection 15(7). (3) The notice must: (a) state the condition or the variation, or state that the condition is revoked; and (b) state the day on which the condition, variation or revocation takes effect.  Accreditation  Chapter 2 Accreditation  Part 2 Varying, suspending and revoking accreditation  Division 3 Section 24 Digital ID Act 2024 Compilation date: 21/02/2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "dc515f831f8d4ac716579ca1268c49283201e9b7058405b9b3cd70915f0f2223" ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-23-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-23-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-23-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
