    skos:prefLabel "40(3) Notification of eligible data breaches—accredited entities that are"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-40-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Part IIIC of the Privacy Act 1988, and any other provision of that Act that relates to that Part, apply in relation to the accredited entity as if the entity were an APP entity." ;
