concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-43 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "43 Information Commissioner may share information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-43 ;
    values:originalText "Sections 33A and 33B of the Privacy Act 1988 apply as if a reference in those sections to that Act included a reference to this Act. Note: Sections 33A and 33B of the Privacy Act 1988 allow the Information Commissioner to share information acquired in the course of exercising powers, or performing functions or duties, under that Act in certain circumstances.  Chapter 3  Privacy" ;
    skos:definition "Sections 33A and 33B of the Privacy Act 1988 apply as if a reference in those sections to that Act included a reference to this Act. Note: Sections 33A and 33B of the Privacy Act 1988 allow the Information Commissioner to share information acquired in the course of exercising powers, or performing functions or duties, under that Act in certain circumstances.  Chapter 3  Privacy"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7234c1d0b40696ac7008e2bf398e3fe8a52f5e57c324c8f5a029bb491c2cc7d6" ;
    cof:pageNumber "57"^^xsd:integer ;
