concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-47-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "47(5) Restricting disclosure of unique identifiers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-47-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Subsections (2) and (3) also do not apply if the disclosure of the unique identifier is: (a) to a contractor engaged by the accredited entity; and (b) for the purposes of the contractor providing an accredited service, or part of an accredited service, of the accredited entity. Note: A person who wishes to rely on this subsection bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter mentioned in this subsection (see section 96 of the Regulatory Powers Act)." ;
    skos:definition "(5) Subsections (2) and (3) also do not apply if the disclosure of the unique identifier is: (a) to a contractor engaged by the accredited entity; and (b) for the purposes of the contractor providing an accredited service, or part of an accredited service, of the accredited entity. Note: A person who wishes to rely on this subsection bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter mentioned in this subsection (see section 96 of the Regulatory Powers Act)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c8f122265b1d0a5b5c06e915c5130421d1c88aaa372465f6e79fdc43f13c378e" ;
    values:partOf concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-47 ;
    cof:pageNumber "60"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Disclosure of unique identifiers is permitted for contractors engaged by the accredited entity." ;
