concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-49-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "49(6) Authorised collection, use and disclosure of biometric"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-49-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) An accredited entity is authorised to retain, use or disclose biometric information of an individual if: (a) the accredited entity collected the information in accordance with subsection (1); and (b) the information is retained, used or disclosed for the purposes of undertaking testing in relation to the information; and  Chapter 3  Privacy" ;
    skos:definition "(6) An accredited entity is authorised to retain, use or disclose biometric information of an individual if: (a) the accredited entity collected the information in accordance with subsection (1); and (b) the information is retained, used or disclosed for the purposes of undertaking testing in relation to the information; and  Chapter 3  Privacy"@en ;
