concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-52 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "52 Other rules relating to biometric information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-52 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Accreditation Rules may provide for and in relation to the collection, use, disclosure, storage or destruction of biometric information of individuals by accredited entities. (2) Without limiting subsection (1), the Accreditation Rules may provide for requirements relating to quality, security or fraud." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Accreditation Rules may provide for and in relation to the collection, use, disclosure, storage or destruction of biometric information of individuals by accredited entities. (2) Without limiting subsection (1), the Accreditation Rules may provide for requirements relating to quality, security or fraud."@en ;
