concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-56 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56 Accredited identity exchange providers must not retain certain"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-56 ;
    values:originalText "attributes of individuals (1) This section applies if, during an authenticated session, an accredited identity exchange provider receives any of the following attributes of an individual: (a) a restricted attribute of the individual; (b) the individual’s name; (c) the individual’s address;  Chapter 3  Privacy" ;
