    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-58 ;
    values:originalText "Government Digital ID System (1) The Digital ID Regulator must oversee and maintain a digital ID system. (2) The Australian Government Digital ID System means the digital ID system overseen and maintained by the Digital ID Regulator under subsection (1)." ;
