concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-62-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "62(4) Approval to participate in the Australian Government Digital ID"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-62-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) However, the Digital ID Regulator must not approve an entity to participate in the Australian Government Digital ID System if a direction under subsection 73(1) (about security) directing the Digital ID Regulator to refuse to approve the entity is in force." ;
    skos:definition "(4) However, the Digital ID Regulator must not approve an entity to participate in the Australian Government Digital ID System if a direction under subsection 73(1) (about security) directing the Digital ID Regulator to refuse to approve the entity is in force."@en ;
