concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-67 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "67 Applying for variation or revocation of conditions on approval"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-67 ;
    values:originalText "(1) An entity that holds an approval to participate in the Australian Government Digital ID System may apply for a condition imposed on the approval under paragraph 64(2)(a) to be varied or revoked.  Chapter 4  Australian Government Digital ID System" ;
    skos:definition "(1) An entity that holds an approval to participate in the Australian Government Digital ID System may apply for a condition imposed on the approval under paragraph 64(2)(a) to be varied or revoked.  Chapter 4  Australian Government Digital ID System"@en ;
