doc:sec-68-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "68(3) Notice before changes to conditions on approval" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Digital ID Regulator must consider any written statement given within the period specified in the notice before making a decision to: (a) impose a condition under paragraph 64(2)(a) on an entity’s approval to participate in the Australian Government Digital ID System; or (b) vary or revoke a condition under subsection 66(1) on an entity’s approval to participate in the Australian Government Digital ID System." ;
    cof:pageNumber "88"^^xsd:integer .

