    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) This section does not apply if the Digital ID Regulator reasonably believes that the need to impose, vary or revoke the condition is serious and urgent.  Australian Government Digital ID System  Chapter 4 Australian Government Digital ID System  Part 2 Participating in the Australian Government Digital ID System  Division 2 Section 69 Digital ID Act 2024 Compilation date: 21/02/2025" ;
