concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-70 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "70 Varying approval to participate in the Australian Government"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-70 ;
    values:originalText "Digital ID System The Digital ID Regulator may vary an approval given to an entity under section 62 to take account of a change in the entity’s name. Note: The Digital ID Regulator can also vary conditions on an approval to participate (see section 66)." ;
    skos:definition "Digital ID System The Digital ID Regulator may vary an approval given to an entity under section 62 to take account of a change in the entity’s name. Note: The Digital ID Regulator can also vary conditions on an approval to participate (see section 66)."@en ;
