doc:sec-71-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "71(5) Suspension of approval to participate in the Australian" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) The Digital ID Regulator may, on application by an entity, suspend an approval given to the entity under section 62. Note: See Part 5 of Chapter 9 for matters relating to applications. Show cause notice must generally be given before decision to suspend" ;
    cof:pageNumber "90"^^xsd:integer .

