concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-77-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "77(3) Holding etc. information outside Australia"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-77-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) An entity is liable to a civil penalty if: (a) the entity is subject to a requirement under the Digital ID Rules made for the purposes of subsection (1); and (b) the entity fails to comply with the requirement.  Australian Government Digital ID System  Chapter 4 Australian Government Digital ID System  Part 2 Other matters relating to the Australian Government Digital ID System  Division 5 Section 78 Digital ID Act 2024 Compilation date: 21/02/2025 Civil penalty: 1,500 penalty units." ;
