concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-84-ss-1b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "84(1B) Accredited entities participating in the Australian Government"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-84-ss-1b ;
    values:originalText "(1B) This subsection applies if: (a) the first entity does not comply with this Act (other than the service levels determined under section 80) in relation to the accredited service; and (b) the non-compliance is not the ground or cause for the action or other proceeding." ;
    skos:definition "(1B) This subsection applies if: (a) the first entity does not comply with this Act (other than the service levels determined under section 80) in relation to the accredited service; and (b) the non-compliance is not the ground or cause for the action or other proceeding."@en ;
