concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-84-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "84(2) Accredited entities participating in the Australian Government"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-84-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) An entity that wishes to rely on subsection (1) in relation to an action or other proceeding bears an evidential burden (within the meaning of the Regulatory Powers Act) in relation to that matter.  Australian Government Digital ID System  Chapter 4 Liability and redress framework  Part 3 Statutory contract  Division 2 Section 85 Digital ID Act 2024 Compilation date: 21/02/2025" ;
    skos:definition "(2) An entity that wishes to rely on subsection (1) in relation to an action or other proceeding bears an evidential burden (within the meaning of the Regulatory Powers Act) in relation to that matter.  Australian Government Digital ID System  Chapter 4 Liability and redress framework  Part 3 Statutory contract  Division 2 Section 85 Digital ID Act 2024 Compilation date: 21/02/2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "11830687f574764eeb11a430ea39cee85a89607552aa01cecfe2b36eb61f0595" ;
    values:partOf concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-84 ;
