concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-92 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "92 Powers of the Digital ID Regulator"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-92 ;
    values:originalText "The Digital ID Regulator has power to do all things necessary or convenient to be done for or in connection with the performance of the Regulator’s functions under this Act.  System Administrator  Chapter 6 Introduction  Part 1  Section 93 Digital ID Act 2024 Compilation date: 21/02/2025 Chapter 6—System Administrator" ;
