concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-97 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "97 Directions to the System Administrator"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-97 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may give written directions to the System Administrator about the performance of the System Administrator’s functions or the exercise of the System Administrator’s powers. (2) A direction under subsection (1) must be of a general nature only. (3) The System Administrator must comply with a direction under subsection (1). (4) A direction under subsection (1) is not a legislative instrument.  Chapter 7  Digital ID Data Standards" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may give written directions to the System Administrator about the performance of the System Administrator’s functions or the exercise of the System Administrator’s powers. (2) A direction under subsection (1) must be of a general nature only. (3) The System Administrator must comply with a direction under subsection (1). (4) A direction under subsection (1) is not a legislative instrument.  Chapter 7  Digital ID Data Standards"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "df76820193ed7ed93d5e5f21bebf0918684307c84a1b19635d9e9d1116399345" ;
    cof:pageNumber "117"^^xsd:integer ;
