concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-102 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "102 Functions of the Digital ID Data Standards Chair"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-102 ;
    values:originalText "The functions of the Digital ID Data Standards Chair are: (a) to make Digital ID Data Standards; and (b) to review those standards regularly; and (c) such other functions as are conferred on the Chair by this Act; and (d) to do anything incidental or conducive to the performance of any of the above functions." ;
    skos:definition "The functions of the Digital ID Data Standards Chair are: (a) to make Digital ID Data Standards; and (b) to review those standards regularly; and (c) such other functions as are conferred on the Chair by this Act; and (d) to do anything incidental or conducive to the performance of any of the above functions."@en ;
