concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-106 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "106 Term of appointment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-106 ;
    values:originalText "The Digital ID Data Standards Chair holds office for the period specified in the instrument of appointment. The period must not exceed 3 years. Note: The Digital ID Data Standards Chair may be reappointed: see section 33AA of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
    skos:definition "The Digital ID Data Standards Chair holds office for the period specified in the instrument of appointment. The period must not exceed 3 years. Note: The Digital ID Data Standards Chair may be reappointed: see section 33AA of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901."@en ;
