concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-109-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "109(5) Remuneration"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-109-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Subsections 7(9) and (13) of the Remuneration Tribunal Act 1973 do not apply in relation to the office of the Digital ID Data Standards Chair. Note: The effect of this subsection is that remuneration or allowances of the Digital ID Data Standards Chair will be paid out of money appropriated by an Act other than the Remuneration Tribunal Act 1973." ;
