concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-112 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "112 Resignation of appointment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-112 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Digital ID Data Standards Chair may resign the Digital ID Data Standards Chair’s appointment by giving the Minister a written resignation. (2) The resignation takes effect on the day it is received by the Minister or, if a later day is specified in the resignation, on that later day." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Digital ID Data Standards Chair may resign the Digital ID Data Standards Chair’s appointment by giving the Minister a written resignation. (2) The resignation takes effect on the day it is received by the Minister or, if a later day is specified in the resignation, on that later day."@en ;
