concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-120-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "120(4) Digital ID Accredited Entities Register"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-120-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If an entity’s accreditation is revoked and the entity does not become an accredited entity again for 12 months after the day the revocation came into force, the Digital ID Regulator must remove the entity from the Digital ID Accredited Entities Register at the end of that period.  Trustmarks and registers  Chapter 8 Registers  Part 3  Section 121 Digital ID Act 2024 Compilation date: 21/02/2025" ;
    skos:definition "(4) If an entity’s accreditation is revoked and the entity does not become an accredited entity again for 12 months after the day the revocation came into force, the Digital ID Regulator must remove the entity from the Digital ID Accredited Entities Register at the end of that period.  Trustmarks and registers  Chapter 8 Registers  Part 3  Section 121 Digital ID Act 2024 Compilation date: 21/02/2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a287f6fff3260efc272598635785cb1d0e71963ff6f64ea785d2436d2b34ab18" ;
    values:partOf concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-120 ;
    cof:pageNumber "132"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Entity removal from register after revocation and non-reaccreditation" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
