concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-126-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "126(3) Injunctions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-126-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of Part 7 of the Regulatory Powers Act, each of the following courts is a relevant court in relation to the provisions mentioned in subsection (1): (a) the Federal Court of Australia; (b) the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2); (c) a court of a State or Territory that has jurisdiction in relation to the matter.  Administration  Chapter 9 Compliance and enforcement  Part 2 Directions powers  Division 2 Section 127 Digital ID Act 2024 Compilation date: 21/02/2025" ;
    skos:definition "(3) For the purposes of Part 7 of the Regulatory Powers Act, each of the following courts is a relevant court in relation to the provisions mentioned in subsection (1): (a) the Federal Court of Australia; (b) the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2); (c) a court of a State or Territory that has jurisdiction in relation to the matter.  Administration  Chapter 9 Compliance and enforcement  Part 2 Directions powers  Division 2 Section 127 Digital ID Act 2024 Compilation date: 21/02/2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b202e717be23b3f9a7071b9c81875b2ea673a269493b16fd469678ee25f07756" ;
