    skos:definition "(1) The Digital ID Regulator may give a direction to the following entities if the Digital ID Regulator considers it necessary to do so to protect the integrity or performance of the Australian Government Digital ID System: (a) accredited entities; (b) entities whose accreditation as an accredited entity is suspended."@en ;
