concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-128-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "128(2) Digital ID Regulator’s power to give directions to protect the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-128-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Digital ID Regulator may give the entity a direction requiring the entity to take specified action directed towards ensuring that the entity does not contravene the provision, or is unlikely to contravene the provision, in the future." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The Digital ID Regulator may give the entity a direction requiring the entity to take specified action directed towards ensuring that the entity does not contravene the provision, or is unlikely to contravene the provision, in the future."@en ;
