    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-131-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The notice must specify: (a) the period within which the compliance assessment is to be undertaken; and (b) whether the compliance assessment must be undertaken: (i) by or on behalf of the Digital ID Regulator; or (ii) by an independent assessor arranged by the entity.  Administration  Chapter 9 Compliance and enforcement  Part 2 Compliance assessments  Division 3 Section 132 Digital ID Act 2024 Compilation date: 21/02/2025" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The notice must specify: (a) the period within which the compliance assessment is to be undertaken; and (b) whether the compliance assessment must be undertaken: (i) by or on behalf of the Digital ID Regulator; or (ii) by an independent assessor arranged by the entity.  Administration  Chapter 9 Compliance and enforcement  Part 2 Compliance assessments  Division 3 Section 132 Digital ID Act 2024 Compilation date: 21/02/2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cbff84d644a5a8e20160a8211174e667c7ea0fc9dcfa07d5d4fc4b6a73c8e342" ;
