doc:sec-131-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "131(4) Compliance assessments" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) The Digital ID Rules may make provision for and in relation to compliance assessments." ;
    cof:pageNumber "146"^^xsd:integer .

concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-131-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "131(5) Compliance assessments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-131-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Without limiting subsection (4), the Digital ID Rules may make provision for or in relation to the following: (a) processes to be followed during a compliance assessment or after a compliance assessment has been conducted; (b) information that must be provided to or by an entity during a compliance assessment or after a compliance assessment has been conducted; (c) requirements in relation to reports to be provided in relation to a compliance assessment; (d) actions the Digital ID Regulator may require the entity subject to a compliance assessment to take during the compliance assessment or after the assessment has been conducted." ;
    skos:definition "(5) Without limiting subsection (4), the Digital ID Rules may make provision for or in relation to the following: (a) processes to be followed during a compliance assessment or after a compliance assessment has been conducted; (b) information that must be provided to or by an entity during a compliance assessment or after a compliance assessment has been conducted; (c) requirements in relation to reports to be provided in relation to a compliance assessment; (d) actions the Digital ID Regulator may require the entity subject to a compliance assessment to take during the compliance assessment or after the assessment has been conducted."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0e9347ba7e3619be36bb4d83059cbf7735a92d700dde326cb0a2534e8953a007" ;
    values:partOf concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-131 ;
    cof:pageNumber "146"^^xsd:integer ;
