    cof:title "133(2) Digital ID Regulator’s power to require information or" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Digital ID Regulator may, by written notice, require the entity: (a) to give to the Digital ID Regulator, within the period and in the manner and form specified in the notice, any such information; or (b) to produce to the Digital ID Regulator, within the period and in the manner specified in the notice, any such documents." ;
    cof:pageNumber "149"^^xsd:integer .

