    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The decision-maker for the reviewable decision must, as soon as practicable after making a decision under subsection (1), give the applicant a written statement of the decision-maker’s reasons for the decision." ;
    cof:pageNumber "157"^^xsd:integer .

concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-139-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "139(3) Reconsideration by decision-maker"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-139-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the decision-maker’s functions under this section are performed by a delegate of the decision-maker for the reviewable decision, the delegate who makes the decision under subsection (1): (a) must not have been involved in making the original reviewable decision; and (b) must hold a position or perform duties of a higher level than the delegate who made the original reviewable decision." ;
    skos:definition "(3) If the decision-maker’s functions under this section are performed by a delegate of the decision-maker for the reviewable decision, the delegate who makes the decision under subsection (1): (a) must not have been involved in making the original reviewable decision; and (b) must hold a position or perform duties of a higher level than the delegate who made the original reviewable decision."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9d9235f7e7c37732290a91dbd7479df0e8b48835cbd0465434e84af81dbbcb80" ;
    values:partOf concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-139 ;
    cof:pageNumber "157"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Delegate must not have been involved in making the original reviewable decision and hold a position or perform duties of a higher level than the delegate who made the original reviewable decision." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
