    cof:title "154(3) Annual report by the Digital ID Regulator" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The report must be given to the Minister by: (a) the 30th day of October; or (b) the end of any further period granted under subsection 34C(5) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.  Chapter 10  Other matters" ;
