doc:sec-156-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "156(2) How this Act applies in relation to non-legal persons" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) If this Act purports to impose an obligation or duty on an entity that is not a legal person, the obligation or duty: (a) is imposed on each person who is an accountable person for the entity at the time the obligation or duty arises or is in operation; and (b) may be discharged by: (i) any person who is an accountable person for the entity at the time the obligation or duty arises or is in operation; or (ii) any person who is authorised by a person referred to in subparagraph (i) to discharge the obligation or duty.  Other matters  Chapter 10 Other matters  Part 4  Section 157 Digital ID Act 2024 Compilation date: 21/02/2025 How non-legal persons contravene this Act" ;
    cof:pageNumber "172"^^xsd:integer .

concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "156(3) How this Act applies in relation to non-legal persons"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-156-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A provision of this Act (including a civil penalty provision) that is purportedly contravened by an entity that is not a legal person is instead contravened by each accountable person for the entity who: (a) did the relevant act or made the relevant omission; or (b) aided, abetted, counselled or procured the relevant act or omission; or (c) was in any way knowingly concerned in, or party to, the relevant act or omission. Meaning of accountable person" ;
    skos:definition "(3) A provision of this Act (including a civil penalty provision) that is purportedly contravened by an entity that is not a legal person is instead contravened by each accountable person for the entity who: (a) did the relevant act or made the relevant omission; or (b) aided, abetted, counselled or procured the relevant act or omission; or (c) was in any way knowingly concerned in, or party to, the relevant act or omission. Meaning of accountable person"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e7f2de51c8179db496264ccc1d4721d43bcdb634f18a64bcb84f3b76412d1d4a" ;
    values:partOf concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156 ;
    cof:pageNumber "172"^^xsd:integer ;
