concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-167-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "167(3) Instruments may incorporate etc. material as in force or existing"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-167-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If a core instrument makes provision in relation to a matter in accordance with subsection (2), the core instrument may also make provision in relation to when changes to an incorporated instrument take effect for the purposes of the core instrument." ;
    skos:definition "(3) If a core instrument makes provision in relation to a matter in accordance with subsection (2), the core instrument may also make provision in relation to when changes to an incorporated instrument take effect for the purposes of the core instrument."@en ;
